Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.75,AR,,0,0,0,,هذا شارع المتنبي يا جدو
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.75,EN,,0,0,0,,This is Al-Mutanabbi Street, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:03.25,AR,,0,0,0,,كل كتاب هنا له حكاية
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:03.25,EN,,0,0,0,,Every book here has a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:05.45,AR,,0,0,0,,جدو، شوف شلون هذا الكتاب! أريده
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:05.45,EN,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, look at this book! I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:07.05,AR,,0,0,0,,أنت كل مرة تريد كل شيء
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:07.05,EN,,0,0,0,,Every time, you want everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:09.55,AR,,0,0,0,,خذه، وبعدين نشرب شاي عند الشابندر
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:09.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Take it, and then we'll have tea at Al-Shabandar Café.
